{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "a",
  "task": "t119",
  "chunk": "a/026",
  "family": "NOR10"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u07179",
   "en": "Cut me a little slack, Shepard. It's not like you're easy to read. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07180",
   "en": "Yeah. I always leave a way out. You know that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07181",
   "en": "I'm here for you. But we're in a rough spot, and the last thing I want to do is muddy things.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07182",
   "en": "Like it's all that clear to start with. Are we the pride of the fleet or not? Are we valued agents or just peons?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07183",
   "en": "It's that easy, huh? Okay, then.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07184",
   "en": "Everything will be fine, Shepard. You'll figure it out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07185",
   "en": "I could get used to it. I guess we have some downtime to figure out what we are, huh?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07186",
   "en": "Oh, so it's back to business after playing me. You're something else, you know?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07187",
   "en": "We're a little past a lot of things.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07188",
   "en": "What happens if this doesn't work out, Shepard? We mutinied. Stole a prototype warship. If they wanted to get technical, they could throw in kidnapping.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07189",
   "en": "And those damned aliens sure love to get technical, don't they?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07190",
   "en": "Preaching to the choir, Shepard. They're walking into the Reapers' claws.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07191",
   "en": "It'll really hit the fan when we get to Ilos.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07192",
   "en": "If things don't go well, I want you to know-- Well, I've enjoyed serving under you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07193",
   "en": "Battlefield flirting is one thing, Shepard. There are regs against fraternization.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07194",
   "en": "Well, I suppose breach of protocol will be pretty far down the list of charges at our courts-martial.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07195",
   "en": "You know what? You're right. About everything. I think about losing you and I can't stand it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07196",
   "en": "The galaxy will just keep going. Everything, even the Reapers, will come around again. But you and I, we are important right now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07197",
   "en": "Shepard, you make me feel... human.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07198",
   "en": "Careful, Shepard. I might think you are abusing your authority. A serious breach of protocol.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07199",
   "en": "I'm glad you didn't.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07200",
   "en": "This can't change anything, Shepard. This is a good crew. The finest I've served with. I don't want to mess it up.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07201",
   "en": "You're right, of course. This is too important to risk messing up the team.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07202",
   "en": "I swear, though, if anything happens to you....",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07203",
   "en": "Take care, Shepard. If you keep me waiting much longer, it damn well better be the end of the galaxy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07204",
   "en": "I don't know... I mean, the regs against fraternization seem kind of petty now. Taking a stolen ship to face a giant extragalactic war machine...",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07205",
   "en": "Seems like the Reapers really know how to play on fears.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07206",
   "en": "We're a hell of an example of humanity's best and brightest, huh?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07207",
   "en": "I don't wanna speak out of turn. I mean, I hope we're close enough after everything we've said already.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07208",
   "en": "Official channels are closed. They were quite clear about that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07209",
   "en": "The ambassador was no help. We got hung out to dry. Again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07210",
   "en": "I pushed as hard as I could. They wouldn't listen.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07211",
   "en": "We'll think of something. I just need to figure things out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07212",
   "en": "We're out of the game for now. I need you to be there while I figure things out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07213",
   "en": "I'm looking for a little personal support here. Knock off the \"good soldier\" crap.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07214",
   "en": "Come on, Kaidan. I can get a salute from anyone on this ship. Sometimes I need a shoulder.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07215",
   "en": "I'm sick of it, too. Maybe we need to take a little initiative.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07216",
   "en": "Can't just pull out a good old-fashioned \"It'll be all right\", can you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07217",
   "en": "That wasn't so hard, now was it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07218",
   "en": "If you get me to melt now, when will I figure out how to save the galaxy?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07219",
   "en": "The Council showed a repeated failure to \"get it.\" They were going to bring humanity down with them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07220",
   "en": "Kaidan, you stopped being a subordinate a long time ago. Don't you think it's time to act like it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07221",
   "en": "Bunk here tonight, Kaidan. With me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07222",
   "en": "Hold that thought. There'll be time for us when this is over. I promise.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07223",
   "en": "You're still hesitating? After all we've been through together? What are you afraid of?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07224",
   "en": "Udina is blind to the big picture. It was time to act. If the greatest casualty is my career, we'll be damn lucky.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07225",
   "en": "I don't know about the \"example\" part. But as far as saving the galaxy, how good are first-timers supposed to be?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07226",
   "en": "I'm just here to get the job done. Let someone else be on the poster.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07227",
   "en": "For now. The Alliance has to catch me before they can strip my rank. What do you need?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07228",
   "en": "I tried. No luck.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07229",
   "en": "Maybe they are.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07230",
   "en": "Don't you think I tried?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07231",
   "en": "Of course not. Just for now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07232",
   "en": "I need you to stay strong.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07233",
   "en": "God, you're dense.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07234",
   "en": "You could be less officious.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07235",
   "en": "Depends who you ask.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07236",
   "en": "There you go again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07237",
   "en": "Business before pleasure.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07238",
   "en": "We're right, they're wrong.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07239",
   "en": "It was time to take control.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07240",
   "en": "We're more than that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07241",
   "en": "Stay with me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07242",
   "en": "This isn't the time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07243",
   "en": "We do all right.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07244",
   "en": "I never claimed to be.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07245",
   "en": "There must be millions here. It can't be possible to track everyone coming and going.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07246",
   "en": "They probably just want to keep everything running. It has to be hard keeping all these cultures working together.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07247",
   "en": "I doubt it's personal. It's got to be a balancing act, like every other government.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07248",
   "en": "Or maybe they just don't like humans.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07249",
   "en": "If you expect to get me in a tinfoil miniskirt and thigh-high boots, I want dinner first.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07250",
   "en": "That'll be enough, Chief.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07251",
   "en": "Damn straight you can't.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07252",
   "en": "Ready to move out, sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07253",
   "en": "Yes, sir. Sorry, sir.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07254",
   "en": "When you put it that way, there's no reason they wouldn't like you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07255",
   "en": "I mean, us. Humans. Ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07256",
   "en": "You don't take much shore leave, do you, L-T?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07257",
   "en": "Um, aye, aye, ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07258",
   "en": "I'll walk drag, ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07259",
   "en": "Aye, aye, ma'am!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07260",
   "en": "Heh. Oh Lord.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07261",
   "en": "Off the record, I think there's something wrong here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07262",
   "en": "This Saren is trying to breed an army of krogan. But we can't get backup from the Council?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07263",
   "en": "This Saren is trading people to aliens for some kind of lost knowledge. But we can't get backup from the Council?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07264",
   "en": "This Saren is looking for records on some kind of galactic extinction. But we can't get backup from the Council?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07265",
   "en": "This Saren is looking for a lost mass relay to who-knows-where. But we can't get backup from the Council?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07266",
   "en": "Yeah, I read a lot of those books when I was a kid. Where the hero goes to space to prove himself worthy of a woman he loves. Or, you know. For justice.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07267",
   "en": "Maybe I was a romantic in the beginning. But I thought about it after Brain Camp-- ah, sorry, \"Biotic Acclimation and Temperance training.\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07268",
   "en": "I'm not looking for \"the dream.\" I just want to do some good. See what's out here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07269",
   "en": "\"Biotic Acclimation and Temperance\" didn't last past the airlock. To the kids they hauled in, it was \"Brain Camp.\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07270",
   "en": "Sorry, \"hauled in\" is unkind. We were \"encouraged to commit to an evaluation of our abilities, so an understanding of biotics could be compiled.\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07271",
   "en": "There are worse results of \"accidental\" exposure to element zero in the womb. Beats the brain tumors some kids grew up with.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07272",
   "en": "Out of a hundred? Maybe sixty have no effect. Thirty suffer \"adverse effects.\" Little things like brain cancer.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07273",
   "en": "The other ten show enough ability to augment with implants. Not always permanent, though. Not like the cancer.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07274",
   "en": "Next thing you know, you're out on Jump Zero. How's a kid supposed to deal with that? A station at the edge of human space?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07275",
   "en": "It's where they did all the \"goose chase\" FTL research. Before we caught on to using mass effect fields.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07276",
   "en": "It was a sterile research platform when I was there.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07277",
   "en": "The grand gateway to humanity looks a lot better in the vids.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07278",
   "en": "Anyway. This was supposed to be a casual debrief, not a bull session about stuff that happened years ago.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07279",
   "en": "Well, you're welcome. Ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07280",
   "en": "You make a habit of getting this personal with everyone?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07281",
   "en": "I'll, uh-- I'll need some time to process that, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07282",
   "en": "But yeah, I'd like that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07283",
   "en": "Bad habit, ma'am. I do tend to run off at the mouth. I will work on it for my next review.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07284",
   "en": "My mother was downwind of a transport crash. It was before there were human biotics. A little after the discovery of the Martian ruins.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07285",
   "en": "It only gets iffy around '63 when Conatix was running out of first-gen subjects. Until then, they'd relied on accidentals.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07286",
   "en": "None. I'm not questioning the mission. I'm just concerned.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07287",
   "en": "Sorry to have wasted your time, ma'am. It won't happen again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07288",
   "en": "Yes, ma'am. Sorry to have wasted your time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07289",
   "en": "I'm right about the mission, though. I know it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07290",
   "en": "I've been thinking about the Feros mission. How the colony ended up failing.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07291",
   "en": "I've been thinking about the Noveria mission. About what we did to the rachni.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07292",
   "en": "We've played it pretty close to the book so far. But we're a long way from backup. We've got some tough calls to make.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07293",
   "en": "I'm just saying... try to leave yourself a way out. I've seen what cutting corners can do to someone. And I'd hate to have that happen to you, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07294",
   "en": "Sorry, ma'am. Maybe I got a bad signal. I mean if you're a-- Maybe there's someone else you'd rather confide in. Ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07295",
   "en": "There's my answer, then. I'm sorry to have bothered you, Commander. I got some mixed signals.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07296",
   "en": "With your permission, I should return to my duties.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07297",
   "en": "I think she's older than both of us put together. But uh, yeah.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07298",
   "en": "She's a very interesting lady. Not to my, uh, tastes. But I never claimed to be big on alien culture.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07299",
   "en": "It's just that-- We don't have much downtime these days. And I like being around you. But I-- I don't want to take up your personal time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07300",
   "en": "I'm not questioning any decision you've made, Shepard. Let me be clear about that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07301",
   "en": "It's just my experience that once someone lets something slide, it tends to pick up speed. You get my meaning?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07302",
   "en": "Oh, I'm sure it's just the humidity.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07303",
   "en": "Y--Yes, Commander. Just had some static on my comm. Got some signals wrong. It won't happen again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07304",
   "en": "I wasn't speaking to you as my commanding officer, ma'am. I don't want to send any bad signals. Just working on what I've picked up.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07305",
   "en": "I, um... I-- I don't want to step on anyone else's toes. Especially if you're a-- Uh, if I have misread your interests.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07306",
   "en": "Maybe that's not my place. I don't want to send any bad signals, Commander. Just, uh, working on what I've picked up.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07307",
   "en": "You tell me if I'm going too far.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07308",
   "en": "No, Commander. Just concerned about the reception of the brass. If things go sour.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07309",
   "en": "I apologize for bringing it up. I know we're getting the job done.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07310",
   "en": "Yes, ma'am. Just had some static on my comm. Got some signals wrong. Won't happen again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07311",
   "en": "Closed. And we're supposed to accept that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07312",
   "en": "So, where do you think the best view will be when the Reapers roll through? If we have to sit it out, may as well get a good seat.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07313",
   "en": "And now he expects us to walk away?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07314",
   "en": "I hope I'm not out of line saying that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07315",
   "en": "You have something up your sleeve, Shepard?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
